   <content contentuid="he662a199g3e1dg7a6eg256eg1c60f592ed54" version="3">对敌人投掷带刺的冰雹。</content>
   <content contentuid="h6ce92674gcf0cg3d21g703dga8a6139ba3a3" version="1">冰甲</content>
   <content contentuid="h1355cc47gfec6gc091g1eadg558429cd3410" version="2">覆盖一层魔法霜冻，增加&lt;LSTag Tooltip='ArmourClass'&gt;护甲等级&lt;/LSTag&gt; [1]。</content>
   <content contentuid="h7caadb8dg1969ge946geca7g62e9eb57e719" version="3">站在暴风雪中可能会使敌人处于&lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="CHILLED"&gt;寒冷&lt;/LSTag&gt;状态。</content>
   <content contentuid="h1a6d1810g6296g3c83gc54bg0b0badde60d6" version="2">在暴风雪中站立超过1回合可能会冻结敌人。</content>
